      "message": "[error] Line 350: 🔴 `buildMsgpackReader\u003cSyncMsg\u003e` has already reassembled and deserialized the complete stream before this callback can call `mergeAccountMetadata`, so the store\u0027s 4 MiB limit is enforced too late. An authenticated device can send a `SyncMsg` containing an arbitrarily large metadata map/value and force unbounded allocation and parsing work, despite the documented metadata limit. Bound the metadata object during reassembly (or use a size-limited metadata envelope/reader) and reject oversized input before materializing it.",
